cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "OpenSim Ultrasonography Pipeline — Bilateral Upper Extremity Trunk (BUET) Model"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-16"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/samrudhau/OpenSim-Ultrasonography-Pipeline"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20252586
abstract: >
  Automated Python pipeline for multi-patient biomechanical analysis of
  sonographers using OpenSim. Integrates the Bilateral Upper Extremity Trunk
  (BUET) model for direct-use (no re-scaling) computation of Inverse Dynamics,
  Static Optimization, and Joint Reaction Analysis on both upper extremities.
  Results are compiled into a JAMOWI-ready master dataset CSV for statistical
  analysis of occupational musculoskeletal loading in ultrasonography tasks.
keywords:
  - OpenSim
  - biomechanics
  - ultrasonography
  - musculoskeletal
  - static optimization
  - inverse dynamics
  - joint reaction analysis
  - bilateral upper extremity
  - BUET model
  - occupational ergonomics
  - Python
authors:
